1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:09,000
In a desert summer, ice sounds impossible. So how did people keep it before electricity?

2
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:18,000
A yakhchal used cold nights, shaded water and a deep earthen chamber to slow heat down.

3
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:27,000
The details varied across time and place, but the design shows how many small ideas can work together.
